-- 535 If an accused who is charged with an indictable offence that is punishable by 14 years or more of imprisonment is before a justice ...
-- The facts about the offence charged that Part XVIII asks (its class, how the prosecutor proceeds, the most the indictable limb allows, and the section 553 facts).
-- src:11882 | 535 If an accused who is charged with an indictable offence that is punishable by 14 years or more of imprisonment is before a justice and a request has been made for a preliminary inquiry under subsection 536(4) or 536.1(3), the justice shall, in accordance with this Part, inquire into the charge and any other indictable offence, in respect of the same transaction, founded on the facts that are disclosed by the evidence taken in accordance with this Part.
@ref s 535 (src:11882-11882)
DECLARE `s 535 the charge` HAS
    `s 535 the class of the offence charged` IS A `Class of offence`
    `s 535 the mode in which the prosecutor proceeds` IS A `Mode of proceeding`
    `s 535 the maximum imprisonment for the offence on indictment` IS AN Imprisonment
    `s 535 the facts that bear on absolute jurisdiction` IS A `s 553 the charge`

§ `Three-valued helpers (not law: they carry a NOTHING through a combination)`

-- Where an input is a MAYBE BOOLEAN because another part (or another section) may leave it unanswered, the combination of two such inputs is FALSE if either is FALSE (for "and"),
-- TRUE if either is TRUE (for "or"), and otherwise NOTHING if either is NOTHING. They restate no text.
GIVEN a IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      b IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 535 three-valued and` MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN JUST x THEN
        IF x
        THEN b
        ELSE JUST x
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        CONSIDER b
        WHEN JUST y THEN
            IF y
            THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): carries the NOTHING of an input through
            ELSE JUST y
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): carries the NOTHING of an input through

GIVEN a IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      b IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 535 three-valued or` MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN JUST x THEN
        IF x
        THEN JUST x
        ELSE b
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        CONSIDER b
        WHEN JUST y THEN
            IF y
            THEN JUST y
            ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): carries the NOTHING of an input through
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): carries the NOTHING of an input through

GIVEN a IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 535 three-valued not` MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (NOT x)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): carries the NOTHING of an input through
